1. LicenseRef-UEI-Proprietary
-------------------------------
   Built into the binaries:
   DataLogger.cpp        SensorConversion.cpp  UEIPACConfig.cpp
   UI/DataLogger_UI.cpp  UeiCJCConverter.cpp

   Installed files:
   /www/cgi-bin/logger.cgi  /www/logger.html

   [REVIEW NOTE - remove before commit] Almost none of the UEI files have a
   copyright or license header today. Add the SPDX header shown below to
   each file.


External components (not included in this directory)
----------------------------------------------------
logger.html loads js/jquery.js, js/jquery-ui.min.js and js/dygraph-
combined.js at runtime. These MIT-licensed files are shipped by ueiroot-
wwwfs and are not covered by this file.


Files not built/installed for the ARM (SoloX) target
----------------------------------------------------
Windows/Visual Studio project files, tests and other build variants in the
SVN module are not part of the Yocto package and are not covered by this
summary.


[REVIEW NOTE - remove before commit] DataLogger.cpp contains the Eclipse
template placeholder "Copyright : Your copyright notice". Replace it with
the UEI header.


